  "body": [
    "Tap to pay in stores with the PayPal Debit Card1 and earn rewards2 online with PayPal checkout.",
    "Get hundreds of offers.2",
    "Also get 5% on purchases in your monthly category3 when you check out with your PayPal Debit Card.",
    "Rideshare and Public Transit",
