    "Earn 3% cash back when you check out with PayPal and 1.5% on all other Mastercard purchases.6",
    "Enjoy special financing on all purchases of $149+ everywhere PayPal or Mastercard is accepted.7",
    "Your payments are encrypted and we don’t share your full financial info",
    "Request money easily.",
    "Simply split the bill with friends and family.",
    "Pool money up front for group gifts and more.10",
